<title>FRANCE: Renault made over 400 mln Fr gain on Elf.</title>
<headline>Renault made over 400 mln Fr gain on Elf.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>French carmaker Renault generated a capital gain of more than 400 million francs from the sale of its stake in Elf Aquitaine, chairman Louis Schweitzer told a shareholders' meeting on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Renault has sold its stake in the capital of Elf Aquitaine, allowing repayment of 1.5 billion francs debt and a non-current cap gain of more than 400 million francs, he said.</p>
</text>
